  speakerName: "Ph\xF3 l\xE0ng"
  title: "Tham quan l\xE0ng"
  content: "\"\u0110i theo t\xF4i n\xE0o. \u0110\xE2y l\xE0 khu d\xE2n c\u01B0, ph\xEDa
    kia l\xE0 kho ch\u1EE9a, c\xF2n xa h\u01A1n n\u1EEFa l\xE0 khu ph\xF2ng th\u1EE7.
    C\u1EADu c\u1EA7n n\u1EAFm r\xF5 t\u1EEBng khu \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111i\u1EC1u h\xE0nh
    l\xE0ng cho t\u1ED1t.\""
